X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/skills/bad-caps
Accept: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/skills/budget-override-attempt
Accept: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### Final list - must be empty (or classpath-only skills)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/skills
Accept: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

